    "updated_at": "2020-10-27T15:13:00Z",
    "body": "This API https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGatt#requestConnectionPriority(int) updates connection parameters on Android (for a GATT client). However you only have a few hardcoded values to select among, and it's not even documented exactly which values will be applied for the different configurations.",
