    "created_at": "2025-02-27T15:51:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-27T15:51:43Z",
    "body": "> , I believe the Central device can start a connection parameter update.\n\nOnly if you have low-level access to the Bluetooth adapter.  Nothing has really changed in the last 5 years and Android is still the only OS that exposes an API that can even have an effect on this.",
